            "review_text": "Chatazito\nBournemouth, United Kingdom22 contributions\n0\nIf you like duck, you will love here\nJul 2016 • Friends\nAs others have said the menu reads boiled duck, roast duck, fried duck, duck liver porridge. Very fast service, nice plate of salad with white radish, another plate os different salad with noodles and peanuts. Two or three dips and then a big pot of porridge kept warm at the table. First time for duck liver and this type of porridge. Would have it all again. \n\nNowhere to get a taxi back was the only drawback. They ordered one which took ages to come and it it seemed like we were miles from anywhere. Well worth it though.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 7, 2016",
