            "review_title": "Review at Quan Vit CU CHI",
            "review_text": "Ricky L\nSingapore, Singapore224 contributions\n0\nFantastic Lunch!!\nJul 2015 • Friends\nEasy drive on the main road and a left turn into the street. A big sign board on both sides of the street welcome you.\n\nVery friendly vietnamese staff quickly attend to you.\n\nNo menu as obviously here for the duck.\nServed with a big plate of succulent roasted duck with a pot of porridge with livers.\n\nThe duck is not oily at all. The meat is tender and juicy. Duck skin is delicious too after removing the layer of oil easily.\n\nThey serve beer and soft drinks. \n\nCrowd are mainly locals and asian foreigners. \n\n278,000 well spent.\nRead more\nWritten July 5, 2015",
